Well, you were actually lucky. When you turn into a new (wo)man, your
level may be adjusted by anything from -2 to +2 levels, completely at
random.

Obviously, you hit the +1 and +2, but that could just as well have been
a -2 and -2. And note that the experience points gained this way will
not count in your final score.

